<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA INFLATION GROWTH SLOWS TO 1.4 PCT IN NOV.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA INFLATION GROWTH SLOWS TO 1.4 PCT IN NOV.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldovan consumer prices rose</p>
<p>1.4 percent in November, compared to 1.6 percent in October, a</p>
<p>report from the State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN CONSUMER PRICES     Nov '96    Oct '96    Nov '95</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		  +1.4	 +1.6	 +6.0</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	    +17	  +23	  +24</p>
<p>Consumer prices in January-November of 1996 grew by 14.1</p>
<p>percent. The National Bank expects annual inflation to drop</p>
<p>this year to 15-17 percent from 23.8 percent in 1995. REUTER</p>
</text>
